-- `child_not_renderable`'s "cannot tell" form (checker-v2.md §25.4): the
-- hole's type is still a variable at its declaration's boundary (9:9), and
-- how a hole updates is chosen from its type, so it must be known — as
-- `ambiguous_interpolation` requires of `${…}`.
import Html exposing (Html)


render value =
    <p>{value}</p>
